  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Promoting Learning in Agribusiness using New Technologies</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">A programme delivered in Southern Nigeria and aimed at creating an interface to link agribusinesses and tech entrepreneurs, in order to raise awareness and increase the uptake of technology by agribusinesses, improve the scalability of tech enterprises in the agriculture sector, and increase the pipeline of demand driven and monetizable technology innovations that address specific opportunities or constraints for agribusiness and commercializing farmers.</narrative>
  </description>
